WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.948
The women put the mongongo nuts into the pot with water and some roots.

2
00:00:05.949 --> 00:00:10.609
They used a long stick to mash everything together.

3
00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.869
As Mandy watched, her stomach began to growl.

4
00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:18.339
"You can do this," said Twi.

5
00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:21.205
She gave Mandy the stick.

6
00:00:21.206 --> 00:00:25.135
Mandy stirred the dark red mixture.

7
00:00:25.136 --> 00:00:31.521
"When the hunters return," said Twi, "we can all enjoy the meal."

8
00:00:31.522 --> 00:00:37.068
Vinnie ran fast until he finally caught up with Kashe and Gau.

9
00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:41.807
They were standing in front of the fallen antelope and smiling.

10
00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:45.869
"Good fortune!" Kashe said to Vinnie.

11
00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:50.334
"Usually antelopes can run for a whole day before the poison spreads.

12
00:00:50.335 --> 00:00:53.029
This one was weak."

13
00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.875
Other hunters appeared from different directions.

14
00:00:56.876 --> 00:01:00.333
"Did the boy get it?" asked a man.

15
00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:04.209
Kashe turned to Vinnie and smiled.

16
00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:07.769
"Perhaps your arrow got this one, Vinnie."

17
00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.853
Vinnie shook his head.

18
00:01:09.854 --> 00:01:13.099
"I was too scared to shoot."

19
00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:15.671
He showed them his arrow.

20
00:01:15.672 --> 00:01:18.410
Kashe stuck his chest out.

21
00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:22.756
Vinnie noticed those six scars on his right side.

22
00:01:22.757 --> 00:01:28.687
"In our tribe, you become a man after your first kill," said Kashe.

23
00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:32.892
"Look here." He pointed to one of his scars.

24
00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:36.816
"I got this when I was your age."

25
00:01:36.817 --> 00:01:40.687
"Did an animal attack you?" asked Vinnie.

26
00:01:40.688 --> 00:01:46.317
Kashe laughed. "No, I killed a male antelope.

27
00:01:46.318 --> 00:01:50.139
That’s why I have scars on my right side.

28
00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:54.708
If it had been a female, I would have scars on my left side."

29
00:01:54.709 --> 00:01:58.333
Kashe then pointed to his eyes.

30
00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:00.676
"These scars make me see clearer.

31
00:02:00.677 --> 00:02:03.955
The ones on my arms help me shoot better.

32
00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:08.460
The scars on my chest help me to stay calm when hunting."

33
00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:11.680
"Didn’t it hurt?" asked Vinnie.

34
00:02:11.681 --> 00:02:15.683
He shivered at what might have made those scars.

35
00:02:15.684 --> 00:02:18.454
Kashe laughed again.

36
00:02:18.455 --> 00:02:20.965
"Pain is part of growing up."

37
00:02:20.966 --> 00:02:24.302
Suddenly Gau shouted loudly.

38
00:02:24.303 --> 00:02:27.135
He pointed toward the trees.

39
00:02:27.136 --> 00:02:31.936
Two large black rhinos were stamping their feet.

40
00:02:31.937 --> 00:02:34.406
"We must leave," warned Kashe.

41
00:02:34.407 --> 00:02:37.092
"We have disturbed them."

42
00:02:37.093 --> 00:02:41.204
Gau and Kashe began to slowly walk backward.

43
00:02:41.205 --> 00:02:45.071
But the angry animals charged the group.

44
00:02:45.072 --> 00:02:48.820
"I didn’t know rhinos ran so fast!"

45
00:02:48.821 --> 00:02:52.002
cried Vinnie as he ran with the men.

46
00:02:52.003 --> 00:02:54.558
Vinnie’s heart was racing too.

47
00:02:54.559 --> 00:02:57.612
Suddenly he heard a scream.

48
00:02:57.613 --> 00:03:01.403
"Gau!" shouted Kashe, looking around.

49
00:03:01.404 --> 00:03:03.933
Gau lay on the ground.

50
00:03:03.934 --> 00:03:08.422
A rhino had slashed Gau’s leg with his horn.

51
00:03:08.423 --> 00:03:12.031
"We must get him to the village," said Kashe.

52
00:03:12.032 --> 00:03:15.733
"Where are the rhinos?" Vinnie asked.

53
00:03:15.734 --> 00:03:18.742
"They’re gone for now," said Kashe.

54
00:03:18.743 --> 00:03:20.612
"Quick, help me."

55
00:03:20.613 --> 00:03:23.683
They carried Gau to the village.

56
00:03:23.684 --> 00:03:27.567
Kashe explained to everyone what had happened.

57
00:03:27.568 --> 00:03:31.487
Gau was placed near a fire in front of one hut.

58
00:03:31.488 --> 00:03:33.874
He was in a lot of pain.

59
00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:37.360
"Call the healer," ordered Kashe.

60
00:03:37.361 --> 00:03:40.932
Frightened, Mandy ran to Vinnie.

61
00:03:40.933 --> 00:03:45.032
"Did he say healer?" gulped Vinnie.

62
00:03:45.033 --> 00:03:55.164
Vinnie remembered the healers from their Iroquois travels.

